{
  spec: "[TSON-DATA] §7.7, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.5"
  description: "'2nd' as an element of a set of identifiers: an identifier never begins with a digit, so the element is a token the type cannot read -- a resolver error ([TSON-DATA] §8.1) -- at its own index. A set's duplicate check compares values, and an element that is not one is in no such comparison."
  schema: "fixtures/validate-identifier.tn"
  error: {
    category: resolver
    path: "/1"
  }
}
